# ground state degeneracies drive the charge-exchange K_eq prefactor
# (MA g=2, MA+ g=1, MB g=4, MB+ g=5), plus a high unpopulated state
MA  2 0.0 0.01 2 2 0   500000.0 0.01 2 2 0
MAp 2 0.0 0.01 1 1 0   500000.0 0.01 1 1 0
MB  2 0.0 0.01 4 4 0   500000.0 0.01 4 4 0
MBp 2 0.0 0.01 5 5 0   500000.0 0.01 5 5 0
